
---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Home Workouts | Silken Valley Lifestyle"
  description="Discover practical home workouts, bodyweight exercises, dumbbell routines, resistance-band training, and fitness ideas for everyday living."
  heroTitle="Home Workouts"
  heroText="Create a convenient and enjoyable fitness routine in the comfort of your own home."
  heroCompact={true}
>
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Fitness & Active Living</p>
    <h1>Creating Your Home Fitness Routine</h1>
    <p>
      Staying active does not require a gym membership or
      an elaborate collection of equipment. With a little
      planning and a comfortable space, you can enjoy a
      variety of workouts at home. Explore simple exercises,
      practical routines, and ways to make regular movement
      part of your everyday lifestyle.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="home-intro">
    <h2>The Benefits of Exercising at Home</h2>
    <p>
      Home workouts offer flexibility, convenience, and the
      freedom to exercise at your own pace. Whether you have
      a few minutes between daily activities or prefer a
      longer planned session, you can create a routine that
      fits your schedule and fitness goals.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="home-grid">
    <article class="home-card">
      <span class="home-number">01</span>
      <h2>Getting Started</h2>
      <p>
        Create a welcoming exercise space and establish
        a routine that feels manageable. Begin with
        simple movements and gradually build consistency.
      </p>
      <h3>Home Fitness Essentials</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Choose a clear, comfortable exercise area.</li>
        <li>Wear supportive clothing and footwear where appropriate.</li>
        <li>Keep a water bottle nearby.</li>
        <li>Start with a gentle warm-up.</li>
        <li>Set realistic and achievable goals.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="home-card">
      <span class="home-number">02</span>
      <h2>Full-Body Home Workouts</h2>
      <p>
        Full-body routines combine movements that work
        different muscle groups in one session. They are
        a convenient way to develop overall strength.
      </p>
      <h3>Exercises to Explore</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Chair squats.</li>
        <li>Wall push-ups.</li>
        <li>Glute bridges.</li>
        <li>Standing marches.</li>
        <li>Bird-dog exercises.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="home-card">
      <span class="home-number">03</span>
      <h2>Dumbbell Workouts</h2>
      <p>
        A pair of appropriately weighted dumbbells can
        add variety to your home fitness routine and
        provide resistance for a range of exercises.
      </p>
      <h3>Exercises to Explore</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Seated or standing bicep curls.</li>
        <li>Shoulder presses.</li>
        <li>Light dumbbell rows.</li>
        <li>Goblet squats.</li>
        <li>Standing calf raises.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="home-card">
      <span class="home-number">04</span>
      <h2>Resistance-Band Exercises</h2>
      <p>
        Resistance bands are compact, versatile, and
        useful for adding gentle or moderate resistance
        to a variety of home exercises.
      </p>
      <h3>Exercises to Explore</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Seated resistance-band rows.</li>
        <li>Standing lateral band walks.</li>
        <li>Band pull-aparts.</li>
        <li>Glute bridges with a loop band.</li>
        <li>Standing arm extensions.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="home-card">
      <span class="home-number">05</span>
      <h2>Bodyweight Exercises</h2>
      <p>
        Bodyweight training uses your own body as resistance.
        These exercises can be adapted to different fitness
        levels and performed without specialized equipment.
      </p>
      <h3>Exercises to Explore</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Modified push-ups against a wall.</li>
        <li>Chair sit-to-stands.</li>
        <li>Standing leg raises.</li>
        <li>Modified planks.</li>
        <li>Step-back movements.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="home-card">
      <span class="home-number">06</span>
      <h2>Stretching & Mobility</h2>
      <p>
        Gentle stretching and mobility exercises can
        complement your fitness routine by encouraging
        comfortable movement and flexibility.
      </p>
      <h3>Movements to Explore</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Gentle shoulder rolls.</li>
        <li>Seated hamstring stretches.</li>
        <li>Calf stretches.</li>
        <li>Gentle hip mobility exercises.</li>
        <li>Comfortable upper-back stretches.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>


<section class="home-equipment">
  <p class="eyebrow">Recommended Equipment</p>
  <h2>Build Your Home Workout Space</h2>
  <p>
    A few practical pieces of equipment can add variety
    to your home fitness routine. Dumbbells are a useful
    addition for resistance exercises, strength training,
    and everyday workouts.
  </p>

  <div class="home-product">
    <h3>Dumbbell Weight Set with Organizer</h3>

    <p>
      Create a convenient home workout space with this
      dumbbell weight set and organizer. Ideal for strength
      training, resistance exercises, and everyday fitness
      routines, while keeping your equipment neatly stored.
    </p>

    <a
      class="home-product-button"
      href="https://www.amazon.ca/PLKOW-Dumbbell-Dumbbells-Medicine-Organizer/dp/B0BYCZWM5Q?crid=TT7JX5EYFB6T&dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.Wgcp9SQPQUkwpzP5-CYFGHf347ea_vN94_D_pT1-N7fvFgHroyRncH4GOIoGQDHHsXmdYqUi1pOc_Z0-fp-e9xMmNKsvHuVUV-fmSpvbacX5zYwSpcobag40Zs_TIqVMrH_v-LQn4qfDYSH4R0DxxxG1TFN4fVThV7aV9beB3y5htt-_p1YFKBGNQ9hMxxOwOPccDBxuarHlI0e39T5d1_ru5yDFzXFAV1_lbD7MGr4nHQkFzb8RnmunHnOXgdrfcqY2wMaxN_pN8Fgbgw-p7GrE57APzwCQnqMsw5929Ro.0icxOz1gR_rK3isq6X5I-f368-MF2fzlV3rx2D2KIG4&dib_tag=se&keywords=weight%2Bset&qid=1795632290&sprefix=%2Caps%2C313&sr=8-21-spons&sp_csd=d2lkZ2V0TmFtZT1zcF9tdGY&th=1&gaOptInStatus=true&linkCode=ll2&tag=silkenvalleyl-20&linkId=3e1607b547aa89270205f69aeb2cae48&gaOptInStatus=true&ref_=as_li_ss_tl"
      target="_blank"
      rel="sponsored nofollow noopener"
    >
      Weight Set
    </a>
  </div>
</section>


  <section class="home-routine">
    <p class="eyebrow">Consistency</p>
    <h2>A Sample Weekly Home Workout Routine</h2>
    <p>
      The following schedule offers a simple framework
      for combining strength, cardio, and flexibility.
      Adjust the activities and duration to suit your
      experience, schedule, and recovery needs.
    </p>

    <div class="home-table">
      <div class="home-row">
        <strong>Monday</strong>
        <span>Full-body strength workout</span>
      </div>
      <div class="home-row">
        <strong>Tuesday</strong>
        <span>Indoor cardio or brisk walking</span>
      </div>
      <div class="home-row">
        <strong>Wednesday</strong>
        <span>Resistance-band exercises</span>
      </div>
      <div class="home-row">
        <strong>Thursday</strong>
        <span>Gentle stretching and mobility</span>
      </div>
      <div class="home-row">
        <strong>Friday</strong>
        <span>Dumbbell or bodyweight workout</span>
      </div>
      <div class="home-row">
        <strong>Saturday</strong>
        <span>Outdoor walk or recreational activity</span>
      </div>
      <div class="home-row">
        <strong>Sunday</strong>
        <span>Rest and recovery</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-note">
    <h2>Make Fitness Part of Everyday Life</h2>
    <p>
      Consistency is more important than perfection.
      Start with short sessions, choose activities you
      enjoy, and gradually build your routine. Include
      rest days, stay hydrated, and allow your body time
      to recover. If you are new to exercise or have
      concerns about an activity, seek appropriate
      professional guidance.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="home-links">
    <h2>Explore More Workouts</h2>
    <div class="home-link-grid">
      <a href="/fitness/workouts/cardio/">Cardio Workouts →</a>
      <a href="/fitness/workouts/strength-training/">Strength Training →</a>
      <a href="/fitness/workouts/low-impact/">Low-Impact Exercise →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <p class="home-back">
    <a href="/fitness/workouts/">← Return to Workouts</a>
  </p>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .home-intro {
    margin: 30px 0;
    padding: 28px;
    background: var(--rose-wash);
    border-radius: 18px;
  }

  .home-intro h2,
  .home-routine h2,
  .home-note h2,
  .home-links h2 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.7rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .home-intro p,
  .home-routine > p:not(.eyebrow),
  .home-note p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .home-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin: 35px 0;
  }

  .home-card {
    padding: 28px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
    border-radius: 18px;
  }

  .home-number {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .home-card h2 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.55rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0 0 13px;
  }

  .home-card h3 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    margin: 22px 0 10px;
  }

  .home-card p,
  .home-card li {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .home-card p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .home-card ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .home-routine {
    margin: 40px 0;
  }

  .home-routine .eyebrow {
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .home-table {
    margin-top: 22px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .home-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 130px 1fr;
    gap: 15px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .home-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .home-row strong {
    color: var(--accent-dark);
  }

  .home-row span {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .home-note {
    padding: 30px;
    margin: 40px 0;
    background: var(--rose-wash);
    border-radius: 18px;
  }

  .home-links {
    margin: 40px 0;
  }

  .home-link-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 15px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .home-link-grid a {
    display: block;
    padding: 18px;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .home-link-grid a:hover {
    background: var(--rose-wash);
  }

  .home-back {
    margin-top: 30px;
  }

  .home-back a {
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .home-back a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .home-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .home-link-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .home-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 5px;
    }
  }

.home-equipment {
  margin: 40px 0;
  padding: 30px;
  background: var(--rose-wash);
  border-radius: 18px;
}

.home-equipment > .eyebrow {
  color: var(--accent-dark);
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.home-equipment h2 {
  font-family: Georgia, serif;
  font-size: 1.7rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--text);
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.home-equipment > p:not(.eyebrow) {
  color: var(--muted);
  line-height: 1.8;
}

.home-product {
  margin-top: 22px;
  padding: 25px;
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 16px;
}

.home-product h3 {
  font-family: Georgia, serif;
  font-size: 1.3rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--text);
}

.home-product p {
  color: var(--muted);
  line-height: 1.8;
  margin-bottom: 22px;
}

.home-product-button {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 13px 25px;
  background: var(--accent);
  color: #ffffff;
  text-decoration: none;
  border-radius: 30px;
  font-weight: 600;
  transition: background 0.25s ease,
              transform 0.25s ease;
}

.home-product-button:hover {
  background: var(--accent-dark);
  color: #ffffff;
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}

</style>
